Retained from upstream: the per-source dispatch pattern (event['source'] ->
extractor function), the per-service ARN-construction logic, and the
CloudFormation packaging approach.

Added in this project: derived Owner/CreatedBy/ManagedBy resolution in place of
static tags, an SSM-backed role-to-owner map, parent-pointer inheritance
(Auto Scaling groups and CloudFormation stacks), a scheduled reconciliation
sweep, tag-collision guardrails, an AWS Config detective rule, and support for
14 additional services.
